  "about": "The secreta of the formulary “Fourth Sunday after Epiphany” in the 1962 Roman Missal. Page 47 prints the proper body and short Per Dominum cue. The full conclusion and Amen are a separate RG115a expansion with declared house orthography, not a continuous page 47 transcription.",
